.TH ANIMSTATE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
AnimState \- Playback position of one animated thing
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsprite.h\(dq
.ft B
typedef struct AnimState { int anim; int frame; float elapsed; bool done; } AnimState;
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Playback position of one animated thing. Pointer\-free, so it can live inside an entity in GameState and survive a save. Drive it with anim_set() to choose an animation and anim_step() every tick; read the sheet frame with anim_frame().
.SH FIELDS
.TP
.B anim
id of the current animation (your index into an Anim table)
.TP
.B frame
frame within the animation, 0..count\-1
.TP
.B elapsed
seconds accumulated toward the next frame
.TP
.B done
true once a non\-looping animation reached its last frame
.SH MODULE
sprite (src/engine/sprite/sprite.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR anim_set (3),
.BR anim_step (3),
.BR anim_frame (3),
.BR Anim (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
